98/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.6em 0.6em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>A</mi></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>165</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>B</mi></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>C</mi></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>105</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, slice <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"35\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> corresponds to a right angle.</p>\n</div></div>             \n\n                           \n                    </div>",
