><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>80</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>78</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>80</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>78</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>78</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>78</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5.</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Thus, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"50\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> cakes are produced when the pastry shop uses the same number of packs of butter and flour.</p>\n</div></div>             \n\n                           \n                    </div>",
